#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:283
msgid "``GET /healthcheck``"
msgstr "``GET /healthcheck``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:285
msgid ""
"Health check endpoint suitable for Kubernetes liveness and readiness "
"probes. A ``200`` response means the HTTP server is alive **and** the MP "
"cache engine object is wired onto ``app.state``. A ``503`` response "
"indicates the engine is not yet present (still initializing, or failed to"
" initialize). The check verifies that the engine attribute is set; it "
"does not call into the engine to assert deeper liveness."
msgstr ""
"健康检查端点适用于 Kubernetes 的存活和就绪探针。``200`` 响应意味着 HTTP 服务器处于活动状态 **并且** MP "
"缓存引擎对象已连接到 ``app.state``。``503`` "
"响应表示引擎尚未存在（仍在初始化中，或初始化失败）。该检查验证引擎属性是否已设置；它不会调用引擎以确认更深层次的存活状态。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:300
msgid "**Response** (``503 Service Unavailable``):"
msgstr "**响应** (``503 服务不可用``):"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:311
msgid "``200``: engine is wired onto ``app.state`` (healthy)."
msgstr "``200``: 引擎已连接到 ``app.state`` (正常)。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:312
msgid ""
"``503``: engine not initialized (still starting up, or failed to "
"initialize)."
msgstr "``503``: 引擎未初始化（仍在启动中，或初始化失败）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:320
msgid "**Kubernetes probe snippet:**"
msgstr "**Kubernetes 探针代码片段:**"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:338
msgid "Inspection and Status"
msgstr "检查和状态"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:341
msgid "``GET /status``"
msgstr "``GET /status``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:343
msgid ""
"Returns a detailed snapshot of the MP engine's internal state. The "
"payload is assembled by ``MPCacheServer.report_status()``: a fixed set of"
" engine-level fields, the full storage-manager status, plus whatever keys"
" each loaded module contributes (so the exact key set depends on which "
"modules are active — ``registered_gpu_ids`` / ``cache_context_meta`` come"
" from the transfer module, ``active_prefetch_jobs`` from the lookup "
"module, and blend modes add their own fields). Intended for operators and"
" debugging, not for monitoring (use Prometheus metrics for time-series "
"data — see :doc:`observability/index`)."
msgstr ""
"返回 MP 引擎内部状态的详细快照。有效负载由 ``MPCacheServer.report_status()`` "
"组装：一组固定的引擎级字段、完整的存储管理器状态，以及每个加载模块贡献的键（因此确切的键集取决于哪些模块处于活动状态 — "
"``registered_gpu_ids`` / ``cache_context_meta`` "
"来自传输模块，``active_prefetch_jobs`` 来自查找模块，混合模式添加它们自己的字段）。旨在供操作员和调试使用，而非监控（使用"
" Prometheus 指标获取时间序列数据 — 参见 :doc:`observability/index`）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:398
msgid ""
"**Response** (``503 Service Unavailable``) when the engine has not yet "
"been initialized:"
msgstr "**响应** (``503 服务不可用``) 当引擎尚未初始化时："

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:409
msgid "``200``: status snapshot returned."
msgstr "``200``: 状态快照已返回。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:410 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:650
msgid "``503``: engine not yet initialized on ``app.state``."
msgstr "``503``: 引擎尚未在 ``app.state`` 上初始化。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:419
msgid "``GET /config``"
msgstr "``GET /config``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:421
msgid ""
"Returns every server-side configuration object registered on "
"``app.state.configs`` (typically ``mp``, ``storage_manager`` and "
"``observability``) as a single indented JSON document. Dataclasses are "
"serialized via ``safe_asdict``; other values go through "
"``make_json_safe``. Useful for confirming what the process actually "
"loaded — including environment overrides — without restarting."
msgstr ""
"以单一缩进 JSON 文档返回注册在 ``app.state.configs`` 上的全部服务器端配置对象（通常包括 ``mp``\\ 、\\ "
"``storage_manager`` 和 ``observability``\\ ）。数据类通过 ``safe_asdict`` "
"序列化；其他值通过 ``make_json_safe`` 处理。可用于确认进程实际加载的配置内容（含环境变量覆盖），无需重启服务。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:446
msgid ""
"**Response** (``503 Service Unavailable``) when configs are not wired "
"onto ``app.state`` yet:"
msgstr "**响应**\\ （\\ ``503 服务不可用``\\ ），当配置尚未连接到 ``app.state`` 时："

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:457
msgid "``200``: configuration document returned."
msgstr "``200``: 配置文档已返回。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:458
msgid "``503``: configs not yet wired onto ``app.state``."
msgstr "``503``: 配置尚未连接到 ``app.state``。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:467
msgid "``GET /config/adapters``"
msgstr "``GET /config/adapters``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:469
msgid ""
"Enumerate every L2 adapter the engine has loaded, in configuration order."
" Which storage backends are loaded is a configuration-inspection concern,"
" so this lives in the config group rather than under ``/cache``. This is "
"the single live adapter listing; it supersedes the old ``GET "
"/reconfigure/backends`` (the reconfigurable backends are the "
"``type_name`` values whose ``reconfigurable`` flag is ``true``)."
msgstr ""
"列出引擎已加载的每个 L2 适配器，按配置顺序排列。加载了哪些存储后端是配置检查的内容，因此它位于配置组中，而不是在 ``/cache`` "
"下。这是唯一的活动适配器列表；它取代了旧的 ``GET /reconfigure/backends``（可重新配置的后端是 "
"``type_name`` 值，其 ``reconfigurable`` 标志为 ``true``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:487
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``primary`` is ``true`` only on the first entry. ``reconfigurable`` is "
"``true`` for adapters that accept ``/reconfigure`` operations — pass that"
" adapter's ``type_name`` as the ``{backend}`` path parameter to ``GET "
"/reconfigure/{backend}/status`` and the reconfigure operations. An engine"
" that has no L2 backends returns ``{\"adapters\": []}`` (still ``200`` — "
"the engine is initialized, it just has no L2 storage)."
msgstr ""
"``primary`` 仅在第一个条目上为 ``true``。``reconfigurable`` 对于接受 ``/reconfigure`` "
"操作的适配器为 ``true`` — 将该适配器的 ``type_name`` 作为 ``{backend}`` 路径参数传递给 ``GET "
"/reconfigure/{backend}/status`` 和重新配置操作。没有 L2 后端的引擎返回 "
"``{\\\"adapters\\\": []}``（仍然是 ``200`` — 引擎已初始化，只是没有 L2 存储）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:496
msgid "``200``: success (including the no-adapters case)."
msgstr "``200``: 成功（包括无适配器的情况）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:497 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:943
#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:988 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1055
#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1094 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1125
#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1155 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1217
#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1288
msgid "``503``: engine not initialized."
msgstr "``503``: 引擎未初始化。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:506
msgid "``GET /version``, ``GET /lmc_version``, ``GET /commit_id``"
msgstr "``GET /version``, ``GET /lmc_version``, ``GET /commit_id``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:508
msgid "Version descriptors. Each returns a bare JSON **string** (not an object):"
msgstr "版本描述符。每个返回一个裸 JSON **字符串**\\ （而不是对象）："

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:510
msgid ""
"``GET /version`` — the combined descriptor from "
"``lmcache.utils.get_version()``, formatted ``\"<version>-<commit_id>\"`` "
"(e.g. ``\"0.3.1-ca79ea33\"``). On a source checkout without build-time "
"version metadata, each missing component falls back to the literal "
"``\"NA\"`` (so a metadata-less build returns ``\"NA-NA\"``)."
msgstr ""
"``GET /version`` — 来自 ``lmcache.utils.get_version()`` 的组合描述符，格式为 "
"``\\\"<version>-<commit_id>\\\"``\\ （例如 "
"``\\\"0.3.1-ca79ea33\\\"``）。在没有构建时版本元数据的源代码检出中，每个缺失的组件将回退为字面值 "
"``\\\"NA\\\"``\\ （因此没有元数据的构建返回 ``\\\"NA-NA\\\"``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:515
msgid ""
"``GET /lmc_version`` — the raw package version string "
"(``lmcache.utils.VERSION``); empty string ``\"\"`` when the generated "
"``lmcache._version`` module is absent."
msgstr ""
"``GET /lmc_version`` — 原始包版本字符串 (``lmcache.utils.VERSION``)；当生成的 "
"``lmcache._version`` 模块缺失时返回空字符串 ``\\\"\\\"``。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:518
msgid ""
"``GET /commit_id`` — the git commit id baked into the build "
"(``lmcache.utils.COMMIT_ID``); empty string ``\"\"`` when unavailable."
msgstr ""
"``GET /commit_id`` — 构建中嵌入的 git 提交 ID "
"(``lmcache.utils.COMMIT_ID``)；当不可用时为空字符串 ``\\\"\\\"``。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:521
msgid "All three are unconditional ``200 OK``."
msgstr "这三者都是无条件的 ``200 OK``。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:531
msgid "``200``: version string returned (unconditional for all three routes)."
msgstr "``200``: 返回的版本字符串（对所有三个路由无条件）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:533 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1384
msgid "**Examples:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:542
msgid "Cache Management"
msgstr "缓存管理"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:545
msgid "``POST /cache/clear``"
msgstr "``POST /cache/clear``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:547
msgid ""
"Force-clears **all** KV cache data currently held in a tier (today "
"``l1``)."
msgstr "强制清除当前在某个层级（今天为 ``l1``）中持有的 **所有** KV 缓存数据。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:551
msgid ""
"This endpoint is destructive and bypasses read/write locks. In-flight "
"store or prefetch operations may be corrupted. Use only when the server "
"is idle, or when recovering from a known-bad cache state."
msgstr "此端点为破坏性操作，会绕过读/写锁。正在进行的存储或预取操作可能因此损坏。仅在服务器空闲时，或在已知缓存状态异常需要恢复时使用。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:555
msgid ""
"**Request body:** optional -- an absent (or empty) body uses the defaults"
" below."
msgstr "**请求体：** 可选 -- 缺失（或空）体将使用以下默认值。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:561 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:608
#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:720 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:903
#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1037
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:562 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:721
#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:904 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1038
msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:564 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:727
msgid "``tier``"
msgstr "``tier``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:565 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:728
#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:735 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:907
#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:919
msgid "string"
msgstr "字符串"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:566
msgid ""
"Optional (default ``l1``). Tier to clear; today only ``l1`` is supported."
" Any other value returns ``400``."
msgstr "可选（默认 ``l1``）。要清除的层级；目前仅支持 ``l1``。任何其他值将返回 ``400``。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:568 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:730
msgid "``force``"
msgstr "``force``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:569 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:731
msgid "bool"
msgstr "布尔值"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:570
msgid ""
"Optional (default ``true``). Currently accepted but **not honored** -- "
"the clear always force-clears (active locks are ignored) regardless of "
"this value."
msgstr "可选（默认 ``true``）。当前被接受但 **不被遵循** -- 清除操作始终强制清除（活动锁被忽略），无论该值如何。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:582
msgid "``200``: tier cleared."
msgstr "``200``: 层已清除。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:583
msgid "``400``: unsupported ``tier`` (anything other than ``l1``)."
msgstr "``400``: 不支持的 ``tier``（除了 ``l1`` 以外的任何内容）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:584
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``503``: server not initialized (``{\"detail\": \"server not "
"initialized\"}``)."
msgstr "``503``: 服务器未初始化 (``{\\\"detail\\\": \\\"服务器未初始化\\\"}``)。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:594
msgid "``POST /cache/checksums``"
msgstr "``POST /cache/checksums``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:596
msgid ""
"Compute MD5 checksums over the engine KV cache, grouped ``chunk_size`` "
"blocks per hashed chunk. MP mode addresses KV storage by block IDs "
"natively (the same units used by ``STORE`` / ``RETRIEVE``), so the "
"endpoint is fully block-centric. Intended for diagnostics and round-trip "
"integrity checks from ``lmcache bench server`` -- not for the inference "
"data path."
msgstr ""
"计算引擎 KV Cache 的 MD5 校验和，每个哈希块分组为 ``chunk_size`` 块。MP 模式通过块 ID 原生地访问 KV "
"存储（与 ``STORE`` / ``RETRIEVE`` 使用的单位相同），因此该端点完全以块为中心。旨在用于诊断和来自 ``lmcache "
"bench server`` 的往返完整性检查——不用于推理数据路径。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:602 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:714
#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:897 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1031
msgid "**Request body:**"
msgstr "**请求主体：**"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:609
msgid "Required"
msgstr "必需的"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:611
msgid "``block_ids``"
msgstr "``block_ids``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:612 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:615
msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:613
msgid "Engine block IDs as a JSON list of ints, e.g. ``[0, 1, 2, 3]``."
msgstr "引擎块 ID 作为整数的 JSON 列表，例如 ``[0, 1, 2, 3]``。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:614
msgid "``chunk_size``"
msgstr "``chunk_size``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:616
msgid "Positive integer — number of blocks per hashed chunk."
msgstr "正整数 — 每个哈希块的块数。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:617
msgid "``instance_id``"
msgstr "``instance_id``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:618
msgid "no (default ``0``)"
msgstr "否（默认 ``0``\\ ）"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:619
msgid "Registered KV context ID on the engine."
msgstr "引擎上注册的 KV 上下文 ID。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:620
msgid "``layerwise``"
msgstr "``layerwise``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:621
msgid "no (default ``false``)"
msgstr "否（默认 ``false``\\ ）"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:622
msgid ""
"If ``true``, return per-layer checksums keyed by ``\"layer_<idx>\"``; "
"otherwise a single aggregated digest per chunk over all layers."
msgstr "如果为 ``true``\\ ，则返回按 ``\"layer_<idx>\"`` 键入的逐层校验和；否则返回每个块的所有层的单个聚合摘要。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:638
msgid ""
"When ``layerwise=true``, ``chunk_checksums`` is a dict keyed by "
"``\"layer_<idx>\"`` whose values are per-layer lists."
msgstr ""
"当 ``layerwise=true`` 时，\\ ``chunk_checksums`` 是一个以 ``\"layer_<idx>\"`` "
"为键的字典，其值是逐层列表。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:643 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:859
msgid "``200``: success."
msgstr "``200``: 成功。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:644
msgid "``400``: ``block_ids`` empty, or ``chunk_size`` missing or non-positive."
msgstr "``400``: ``block_ids`` 为空，或者 ``chunk_size`` 缺失或非正数。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:645
msgid ""
"``404``: ``instance_id`` not registered, or the registered KV tensors are"
" empty."
msgstr "``404``: ``instance_id`` 未注册，或者注册的 KV 张量为空。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:647
msgid ""
"``501``: engine has no ``cache_contexts``, or the KV format is not "
"supported by this endpoint (page-buffer-fused and cross-layer layouts are"
" declined until a real need appears)."
msgstr "``501``: 引擎没有 ``cache_contexts``\\ ，或者该端点不支持 KV 格式（页面缓冲融合和跨层布局在真正需要之前被拒绝）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:663
msgid "Cache Objects And Prefetch"
msgstr "缓存对象和预取"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:665
msgid ""
"Two endpoints — ``DELETE /cache/objects`` and ``GET /cache/objects`` — "
"let operators purge keys from a configured cache backend and enumerate "
"what is currently resident. (To enumerate the configured backends "
"themselves, use ``GET /config/adapters`` in the config group.)"
msgstr ""
"两个端点 — ``DELETE /cache/objects`` 和 ``GET /cache/objects`` — "
"允许操作员从配置的缓存后端中清除键并列举当前驻留的内容。（要列举配置的后端本身，请在配置组中使用 ``GET "
"/config/adapters``。）"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:670
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A further pair — ``POST /cache/prefetches`` and ``GET "
"/cache/prefetches/{request_id}`` — lets an operator (or the coordinator) "
"**pre-warm** a node's L1 from L2 ahead of traffic and poll the load to "
"completion; they are documented at the end of this section. The "
"coordinator exposes an ``instance_id``-routed variant of both — see "
":doc:`coordinator`."
msgstr ""
"另一对 — ``POST /cache/prefetches`` 和 ``GET /cache/prefetches/{request_id}``"
" — 允许操作员（或协调者）**预热**节点的 L1 以便在流量到来之前从 L2 "
"加载，并轮询加载直到完成；它们在本节末尾有文档说明。协调者提供了一个基于 ``instance_id`` 的变体 — 参见 "
":doc:`coordinator`。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:677
msgid ""
"Both object endpoints take an optional ``adapter`` selector — a query "
"parameter on ``GET /cache/objects`` (``?adapter=<type_name>``) and a body"
" field on ``DELETE /cache/objects``. Omit it to target the **primary** "
"(first-configured) adapter. When multiple adapters share a ``type_name``,"
" the first match wins. Use ``GET /config/adapters`` to learn the valid "
"selectors."
msgstr ""
"两个对象端点都接受一个可选的 ``adapter`` 选择器 — 在 ``GET /cache/objects`` "
"上的查询参数（``?adapter=<type_name>``）和在 ``DELETE /cache/objects`` "
"上的主体字段。省略它将针对 **主要**（首次配置的）适配器。当多个适配器共享同一个 ``type_name`` "
"时，第一个匹配的适配器将生效。使用 ``GET /config/adapters`` 来了解有效的选择器。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:684
msgid ""
"Both are intended for operator / admin workflows (\"purge this user's "
"keys\", \"show me what's resident\", \"garbage-collect orphans after a "
"rename\"). They are **not** on the inference data path."
msgstr "这两个接口旨在用于操作员/管理员工作流程（“清除该用户的键”，“显示当前驻留的内容”，“在重命名后收集孤儿”）。它们**不**在推理数据路径上。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:688
msgid ""
"``DELETE /cache/objects`` deletes from L1, L2, or both, selected by its "
"``tier`` field (default ``l2``). ``GET /cache/objects`` lists L2 only."
msgstr "``DELETE /cache/objects`` 从 L1、L2 或两者中删除，具体取决于其 ``tier`` 字段（默认为 ``l2``）。``GET /cache/objects`` 仅列出 L2。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:691
msgid ""
"The coordinator's eviction loop uses ``DELETE /cache/objects`` "
"automatically (see :doc:`coordinator` — \"L2 usage tracking and "
"eviction\"); the ``GET /cache/objects`` endpoint also powers the "
"coordinator's startup resync. Manual ``curl`` usage is reserved for ad-"
"hoc operator actions and debugging."
msgstr ""
"协调器的逐出循环自动使用 ``DELETE /cache/objects``（参见 :doc:`coordinator` — “L2 "
"使用跟踪和逐出”）；``GET /cache/objects`` 端点也支持协调器的启动重新同步。手动使用 ``curl`` "
"保留给临时操作员操作和调试。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:698
msgid "``DELETE /cache/objects``"
msgstr "``DELETE /cache/objects``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:700
msgid ""
"Delete a caller-supplied list of keys from L1, L2, or both (``tier``). "
"Idempotent: absent keys are skipped silently. L2 deletes skip keys locked"
" by in-flight store/load tasks so an active transfer is never corrupted; "
"L1 deletes skip read/write-locked keys unless ``force`` is set. Blocking "
"adapter I/O is run off the event loop. When the tier includes L2 the "
"primary (or selected) L2 adapter must be configured, else ``503``; a pure"
" ``l1`` delete needs no adapter."
msgstr "从 L1、L2 或两者（``tier``）中删除调用者提供的键列表。幂等：缺失的键会被静默跳过。L2 删除会跳过被正在进行的存储/加载任务锁定的键，因此活动传输不会被损坏；L1 删除会跳过被读/写锁定的键，除非设置了 ``force``。阻塞适配器 I/O 在事件循环之外运行。当层级包含 L2 时，必须配置主要（或选择的）L2 适配器，否则返回 ``503``；纯 ``l1`` 删除不需要适配器。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:707
msgid ""
"Per-key successful L2 deletions fire ``on_l2_keys_deleted`` on the "
"adapter's listeners — when the coordinator is wired (see "
"``--coordinator-l2-event-reporting``), the deletions show up at the "
"coordinator's ``POST /quota/events`` as ``\"type\": \"delete\"`` events. "
"The coordinator's eviction + usage trackers learn about the deletion from"
" that event flow, not from the response of this call."
msgstr "每个成功的 L2 删除会在适配器的监听器上触发 ``on_l2_keys_deleted`` — 当协调器已连接时（参见 ``--coordinator-l2-event-reporting``），删除会以 ``\\\"type\\\": \\\"delete\\\"`` 事件的形式出现在协调器的 ``POST /quota/events`` 中。协调器的逐出 + 使用跟踪器通过该事件流了解删除情况，而不是通过此调用的响应。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:723
msgid "``keys``"
msgstr "``keys``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:724
msgid "list[EncodedObjectKey]"
msgstr "列表[编码对象键]"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:725
msgid ""
"Required. The object keys to delete (schema below). The batch is capped "
"at ``10000`` keys per request."
msgstr "必填。要删除的对象键（见下方模式）。每个请求的批量限制为 ``10000`` 个键。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:729
msgid "Optional (default ``l2``). One of ``l1`` / ``l2`` / ``all``."
msgstr "可选（默认 ``l2``）。可以是 ``l1`` / ``l2`` / ``all``。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:732
msgid ""
"Optional (default ``false``). When ``true``, delete an L1 key even if it "
"is read/write-locked (no effect on L2)."
msgstr "可选（默认 ``false``）。当 ``true`` 时，即使 L1 键被读/写锁定也会删除该键（对 L2 没有影响）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:734 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:811
msgid "``adapter``"
msgstr "``adapter``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:736
msgid ""
"Optional (default: primary, first-configured adapter). The ``type_name`` "
"of the target L2 adapter (see ``GET /config/adapters``); ignored when "
"``tier`` is ``l1``."
msgstr "可选（默认：主，首次配置的适配器）。目标 L2 适配器的 ``type_name``（见 ``GET /config/adapters``）；当 ``tier`` 为 ``l1`` 时被忽略。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:740
msgid "Each ``EncodedObjectKey`` is"
msgstr "每个 ``EncodedObjectKey`` 是"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:752
msgid ""
"``object_group_id`` (default ``0``) and ``cache_salt`` (default ``\"\"``)"
" are optional for backward compatibility with older wire payloads."
msgstr ""
"``object_group_id``（默认 ``0``）和 ``cache_salt``（默认 ``\"\"``）是为了与旧的 wire "
"负载向后兼容而可选的。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:765
msgid ""
"``deleted`` is the total keys removed across the requested tiers (L1 "
"removals plus the L2 batch size); ``skipped`` is the L1 keys refused "
"because they were locked (non-force only). On an L2 adapter failure the "
"response is still ``200`` with ``ok=false`` and an ``error`` field "
"carrying the reason."
msgstr "``deleted`` 是在请求的层级中移除的总键数（L1 移除加上 L2 批量大小）；``skipped`` 是因为被锁定而拒绝的 L1 键（仅限非强制）。在 L2 适配器失败时，响应仍然是 ``200``，并且 ``ok=false``，同时 ``error`` 字段携带原因。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:772
msgid "``200``: request processed (check ``ok`` for the L2 adapter outcome)."
msgstr "``200``: 请求已处理（检查 ``ok`` 以获取 L2 适配器的结果）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:773
msgid ""
"``400``: batch exceeds the limit, or a key payload violates an "
"``ObjectKey`` invariant (bad hex, ``@`` in ``model_name``, forbidden "
"``cache_salt`` character)."
msgstr ""
"``400``: 批量超出限制，或者一个键负载违反了 ``ObjectKey`` 不变式（错误的十六进制，``model_name`` 中的 "
"``@``，禁止的 ``cache_salt`` 字符）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:776
msgid "``404``: ``adapter`` (body) does not match any configured adapter."
msgstr "``404``: ``adapter``（主体）与任何已配置的适配器不匹配。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:777
msgid ""
"``422``: Pydantic-level body-shape failure (missing ``keys``, wrong field"
" types)."
msgstr "``422``: Pydantic 级别的主体形状失败（缺少 ``keys``，字段类型错误）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:779
msgid ""
"``503``: engine not initialized, or no L2 adapters configured (only when "
"``tier`` includes L2)."
msgstr "``503``: 引擎未初始化，或未配置 L2 适配器（仅当 ``tier`` 包含 L2 时）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:782
msgid "**Example:** delete from both tiers."
msgstr "**示例:** 从两个层级中删除。"

