msgid "none"
msgstr "无"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:818
msgid "Restrict the result to keys whose ``model_name`` matches."
msgstr "将结果限制为与 ``model_name`` 匹配的键。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:819
msgid "``page_size``"
msgstr "``page_size``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:820
msgid "``500``"
msgstr "``500``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:821
msgid ""
"Max entries per page. Must be in ``[1, 5000]``; an out-of-range value is "
"rejected with ``422`` (it is not silently clamped)."
msgstr "每页最大条目数。必须在 ``[1, 5000]`` 范围内；超出范围的值将被拒绝并返回 ``422``\\ （不会被静默限制）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:823
msgid "``page_token``"
msgstr "``page_token``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:825
msgid ""
"Opaque cursor from the previous page's ``next_page_token``. Omit on the "
"first call; pass back verbatim on subsequent calls."
msgstr "来自上一页的 ``next_page_token`` 的不透明游标。在第一次调用时省略；在后续调用中逐字传回。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:828
msgid ""
"The page token is private to the adapter; do not parse or modify it. "
"Adapters that support listing (currently only the S3 adapter via "
"``ListObjectsV2``) guarantee best-effort consistency, not snapshot "
"isolation — concurrent stores or deletes during a paginated walk may "
"cause keys to appear, disappear, or shift between pages."
msgstr ""
"页面令牌是适配器私有的；请勿解析或修改它。支持列出功能的适配器（目前仅通过 ``ListObjectsV2`` 的 S3 "
"适配器）保证尽力而为的一致性，而不是快照隔离——在分页遍历期间的并发存储或删除可能导致键出现、消失或在页面之间移动。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:855
msgid "``next_page_token`` is ``null`` when the listing is exhausted."
msgstr "``next_page_token`` 在列出内容耗尽时为 ``null``。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:860
msgid "``400``: malformed ``page_token`` (adapter-level)."
msgstr "``400``: 错误的 ``page_token``\\ （适配器级别）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:861
msgid "``404``: ``?adapter=<name>`` does not match any configured adapter."
msgstr "``404``: ``?adapter=<name>`` 与任何已配置的适配器不匹配。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:862
msgid "``422``: ``page_size`` outside ``[1, 5000]``."
msgstr "``422``: ``page_size`` 超出 ``[1, 5000]`` 范围。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:863
msgid ""
"``501``: selected adapter does not implement listing. In v1 only "
"``S3L2Adapter`` does; adapters wrapped by ``SerdeL2AdapterWrapper`` "
"inherit the wrapped adapter's behavior."
msgstr ""
"``501``: 选定的适配器不支持列出。在 v1 中，只有 ``S3L2Adapter`` 支持；由 "
"``SerdeL2AdapterWrapper`` 包装的适配器继承被包装适配器的行为。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:866
msgid "``503``: engine not initialized, or no L2 adapters configured."
msgstr "``503``: 引擎未初始化，或未配置 L2 适配器。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:868
msgid "**Example:** paginate every key for a model."
msgstr "**示例：** 为模型分页每个键。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:881
msgid "``POST /cache/prefetches``"
msgstr "``POST /cache/prefetches``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:883
msgid ""
"Warm one node's L1 by loading a token sequence's chunks from L2 **ahead**"
" of the requests that will use them, so the first request hits L1 instead"
" of paying the L2 fetch inline. Useful when a workload is about to be "
"routed to a node (a traffic shift, a hot shared system prompt)."
msgstr ""
"通过从 L2 **提前** 加载一个令牌序列的块来预热一个节点的 L1，以便使用它们的第一个请求命中 L1，而不是在线支付 L2 "
"获取的费用。当工作负载即将路由到一个节点（流量转移、热共享系统提示）时，这非常有用。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:888
msgid ""
"The caller describes content by **token ids**, never by internal cache "
"keys (a key is a content hash plus a per-rank layout bitmap, which "
"callers cannot construct). The server hashes the tokens, expands each "
"chunk across the node's ranks, and submits a *warm* prefetch: loaded "
"chunks are **retained** (permanent) and left **unlocked** — there is no "
"downstream reader to pin them for, so a later real lookup takes its own "
"lock. The call returns immediately; the load runs in the storage "
"manager's own thread. It coalesces across all configured L2 adapters, so "
"there is no ``?adapter=`` selector."
msgstr ""
"调用者通过 **token ids** 描述内容，而不是通过内部缓存键（键是内容哈希加上每个排名的布局位图，调用者无法构造）。服务器对 "
"tokens 进行哈希，将每个块扩展到节点的各个排名，并提交一个 *warm* 预取：加载的块被 **保留**（永久）并保持 **解锁** — "
"没有下游读取器来固定它们，因此后续的真实查找会自行加锁。调用立即返回；加载在存储管理器自己的线程中运行。它在所有配置的 L2 "
"适配器之间合并，因此没有 ``?adapter=`` 选择器。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:908
msgid "The served model id, exactly as registered (e.g. ``Qwen/Qwen3-8B``)."
msgstr "提供的模型 ID，完全按照注册的方式（例如 ``Qwen/Qwen3-8B``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:909
msgid "``world_size``"
msgstr "``world_size``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:910
msgid "int"
msgstr "整数"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:911
msgid ""
"The value vLLM registered for the node's KV layout and rank fan-out "
"(``1`` for a single-GPU, TP=1 deployment)."
msgstr "节点的 KV 布局和排名分发中注册的值 vLLM（对于单 GPU，TP=1 部署为 ``1``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:913
msgid "``token_ids``"
msgstr "``token_ids``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:914
msgid "list[int]"
msgstr "列表[int]"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:915
msgid ""
"The prompt token ids. Must use the same tokenizer / special-token "
"settings as the store, and contain at least one full ``chunk_size`` of "
"tokens — only complete chunks are warmed."
msgstr "提示令牌 ID。必须使用与存储相同的分词器/特殊令牌设置，并且至少包含一个完整的 ``chunk_size`` 令牌——只有完整的块会被预热。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:918
msgid "``cache_salt``"
msgstr "``cache_salt``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:920
msgid "Per-tenant key isolation; must match the store (default ``\"\"``)."
msgstr "每个租户的密钥隔离；必须与存储匹配（默认 ``\"\"``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:922
msgid "**Response** (``202 Accepted``):"
msgstr "**响应** (``202 Accepted``):"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:928
msgid ""
"When the sequence is shorter than one chunk, nothing is submitted and "
"there is no ``request_id`` to poll:"
msgstr "当序列短于一个块时，不会提交任何内容，也没有 ``request_id`` 可供轮询："

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:937
msgid "``202``: submitted (or a ``noop`` as above)."
msgstr "``202``: 已提交（或如上所述的 ``noop``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:938
msgid ""
"``400``: ``token_ids`` exceeds the per-request cap, or ``cache_salt`` "
"violates its invariants."
msgstr "``400``: ``token_ids`` 超过每个请求的上限，或 ``cache_salt`` 违反了其不变性。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:940
msgid ""
"``409``: no layout registered for ``(model_name, world_size)`` — the "
"model has not allocated KV cache on this node yet (start vLLM first)."
msgstr ""
"``409``: 未为 ``(model_name, world_size)`` 注册布局 — 该模型尚未在此节点上分配 KV "
"Cache（请先启动 vLLM）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:942
msgid "``422``: request body fails field-level validation."
msgstr "``422``: 请求体未通过字段级验证。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:956
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``GET /cache/prefetches/{request_id}``"
msgstr "``GET /cache/prefetches/{request_id}``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:958
msgid ""
"Poll a submitted warm prefetch. The warm holds no lock, so the poll only "
"reports progress; the first poll that observes completion drops the job "
"(exactly-once), so a later poll for the same id returns ``404``."
msgstr ""
"轮询已提交的热预取。热预取不持有锁，因此轮询仅报告进度；第一个观察到完成的轮询将删除作业（精确一次），因此对同一 ID 的后续轮询返回 "
"``404``。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:962
msgid "**Response** (``200 OK``) while the load runs:"
msgstr "**响应** (``200 OK``) 当负载运行时："

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:968
msgid "…and once complete:"
msgstr "…并且一旦完成："

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:974
msgid ""
"``found_keys`` / ``total_keys`` count only chunks **loaded from L2** by "
"this request; chunks already resident in L1 are skipped at "
"``reserve_write`` and not counted, so a partially-resident warm "
"undercounts by the resident chunk count (a cold request loads and counts "
"everything). The warm uses the gap-tolerant ``SPARSE`` trim policy, so an"
" already-resident chunk does not stop the rest from loading — it loads "
"every not-yet-resident chunk and reports that count. Not counting the "
"resident chunks is deliberate: an already-present entry may be a "
"transient temporary from another lookup, so claiming it as warmed could "
"mislead."
msgstr ""
"``found_keys`` / ``total_keys`` 计数仅包括由此请求 **从 L2 加载的** 块；已经驻留在 L1 的块在 "
"``reserve_write`` 时被跳过且不计入，因此部分驻留的热请求会低估驻留块的数量（冷请求会加载并计算所有内容）。热请求使用间隙容忍的 "
"``SPARSE`` "
"剪裁策略，因此一个已经驻留的块不会阻止其他块的加载——它会加载每个尚未驻留的块并报告该数量。不计算驻留块是故意的：一个已经存在的条目可能是来自另一个查找的瞬态临时条目，因此将其视为热请求可能会误导。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:985
msgid "``200``: status reported (``pending`` or ``completed``)."
msgstr "``200``: 状态报告（``pending`` 或 ``completed``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:986
msgid ""
"``404``: unknown ``request_id`` — already completed-and-consumed, or "
"never submitted."
msgstr "``404``: 未知 ``request_id`` — 已经完成并消费，或从未提交。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1000
msgid "Quota Management"
msgstr "配额管理"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1002
msgid ""
"These endpoints manage the per-``cache_salt`` storage budgets consumed by"
" the ``IsolatedLRU`` eviction policy (selected via ``--eviction-policy "
"IsolatedLRU``). Quotas are **soft**: setting a limit does not reject "
"writes — any over-budget ``cache_salt`` is evicted at the next eviction "
"cycle (~1 s). A ``cache_salt`` with no registered quota has an effective "
"limit of ``0`` bytes, so its data is cleared next cycle (allowlist "
"semantics)."
msgstr ""
"这些端点管理由 ``IsolatedLRU`` 逐出策略（通过 ``--eviction-policy IsolatedLRU`` "
"选择）消耗的每个 ``cache_salt`` 存储预算。配额是 **软性** 的：设置限制并不会拒绝写入 — 任何超出预算的 "
"``cache_salt`` 会在下一个逐出周期（约 1 秒）被逐出。没有注册配额的 ``cache_salt`` 有一个有效限制为 ``0`` "
"字节，因此其数据将在下一个周期被清除（白名单语义）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1010
msgid ""
"These endpoints are no-ops on engines that did not start with "
"``--eviction-policy IsolatedLRU``: the ``QuotaManager`` is still present,"
" but the LRU policy ignores the registered quotas."
msgstr ""
"对于未使用 ``--eviction-policy IsolatedLRU`` 启动的引擎，这些端点为空操作：\\ "
"``QuotaManager`` 仍然存在，但 LRU 策略会忽略已注册的配额。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1014
msgid ""
"**URL escaping for the empty salt.** ``cache_salt=\"\"`` (un-salted / "
"anonymous traffic) cannot appear in a URL path parameter, so the API "
"accepts the sentinel ``_default`` in its place. ``PUT /quota/_default`` "
"sets the quota for ``cache_salt=\"\"``, and ``_default`` is echoed back "
"in responses for the empty salt. A user that legitimately stores data "
"with ``cache_salt=\"_default\"`` cannot be managed via this HTTP API "
"distinctly from anonymous traffic — both map to the same path parameter; "
"pick any other value (e.g. ``\"default\"``) to disambiguate."
msgstr ""
"**空盐的 URL 转义。** ``cache_salt=\\\"\\\"``\\ （无盐/匿名流量）不能出现在 URL 路径参数中，因此 API"
" 接受哨兵 ``_default`` 作为替代。``PUT /quota/_default`` 设置 "
"``cache_salt=\\\"\\\"`` 的配额，``_default`` 在空盐的响应中被回显。合法存储数据的用户 "
"``cache_salt=\\\"_default\\\"`` 不能通过此 HTTP API "
"与匿名流量区分管理——两者映射到相同的路径参数；选择任何其他值（例如 ``\\\"default\\\"``）以消除歧义。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1024
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``PUT /quota/{cache_salt}``"
msgstr "``PUT /quota/{cache_salt}``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1026
msgid "Create or update a quota."
msgstr "创建或更新配额。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1028
msgid ""
"**Path parameters:** ``cache_salt`` — tenant identifier (use ``_default``"
" for the empty salt; see the section intro)."
msgstr "**路径参数:** ``cache_salt`` — 租户标识符（使用 ``_default`` 表示空盐；请参阅章节介绍）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1040
msgid "``limit_gb``"
msgstr "``limit_gb``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1041
msgid "float"
msgstr "浮点数"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1042
msgid "Required. The quota in GB. Must be finite and non-negative."
msgstr "必需。配额以 GB 为单位。必须是有限的且非负的。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1052
msgid "``200``: quota set or updated."
msgstr "``200``: 配额已设置或更新。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1053
msgid ""
"``400``: malformed JSON, missing ``limit_gb``, non-numeric ``limit_gb``, "
"``nan`` / ``inf``, or a negative value."
msgstr "``400``: JSON 格式错误，缺少 ``limit_gb``，``limit_gb`` 非数字，``nan`` / ``inf``，或负值。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1066
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``GET /quota/{cache_salt}``"
msgstr "``GET /quota/{cache_salt}``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1068
msgid "Read the current quota and live usage for one ``cache_salt``."
msgstr "读取当前配额和一个 ``cache_salt`` 的实时使用情况。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1070 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1109
msgid ""
"**Path parameters:** ``cache_salt`` — tenant identifier (use ``_default``"
" for the empty salt)."
msgstr "**路径参数:** ``cache_salt`` — 租户标识符（使用 ``_default`` 表示空盐）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1084
msgid ""
"``exists`` is ``false`` when no quota was ever registered for this "
"``cache_salt`` (``limit_gb`` is then ``0.0`` and ``current_usage_gb`` "
"reflects whatever bytes are currently cached for that salt — those bytes "
"will evict next cycle under ``IsolatedLRU``). This endpoint never returns"
" ``404`` for an unknown salt."
msgstr ""
"``exists`` 为 ``false`` 当这个 ``cache_salt`` 从未注册过配额时（``limit_gb`` 此时为 "
"``0.0``，而 ``current_usage_gb`` 反映当前为该盐缓存的字节数——这些字节将在下一个周期下逐出 "
"``IsolatedLRU``）。这个端点对于未知的盐永远不会返回 ``404``。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1092
msgid ""
"``200``: quota and usage returned (also when the salt has no registered "
"quota — ``exists`` is then ``false``; never ``404``)."
msgstr "``200``: 返回配额和使用情况（即使盐没有注册配额——此时 ``exists`` 为 ``false``；永远不会 ``404``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1103
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``DELETE /quota/{cache_salt}``"
msgstr "``DELETE /quota/{cache_salt}``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1105
msgid ""
"Remove a ``cache_salt``'s quota entry. Any bytes still cached under this "
"``cache_salt`` become over-budget on the next eviction cycle (effective "
"limit drops to ``0``) and will be evicted."
msgstr ""
"删除 ``cache_salt`` 的配额条目。任何仍然缓存于此 ``cache_salt`` 下的字节将在下一个逐出周期中超出预算（有效限制降至"
" ``0``\\ ），并将被逐出。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1118
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"When no quota was registered for the given ``cache_salt``, the response "
"is ``{\"cache_salt\": \"...\", \"status\": \"not_found\"}`` (still ``200 "
"OK``)."
msgstr ""
"当给定的 ``cache_salt`` 没有注册配额时，响应为 ``{\\\"cache_salt\\\": \\\"...\\\", "
"\\\"status\\\": \\\"not_found\\\"}``\\ （仍然是 ``200 OK``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1123
msgid ""
"``200``: quota entry removed (``\"removed\"``) or none existed "
"(``\"not_found\"``); never ``404``."
msgstr "``200``: 配额条目已移除 (``\"removed\"``) 或不存在 (``\"not_found\"``)；永远不会是 ``404``。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1134
msgid "``GET /quota``"
msgstr "``GET /quota``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1136
msgid "List every registered quota alongside its live usage."
msgstr "列出每个注册的配额及其实时使用情况。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1149
msgid ""
"Only ``cache_salt`` values with a **registered** quota appear; the empty "
"salt is reported under the ``_default`` key."
msgstr "只有带有 **注册** 配额的 ``cache_salt`` 值会出现；空盐会在 ``_default`` 键下报告。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1154
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``200``: quota listing returned (``{\"users\": {}}`` when none "
"registered)."
msgstr "``200``: 返回配额列表 (``{\\\"users\\\": {}}`` 当没有注册时)。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1166
msgid "Runtime L2 Reconfiguration"
msgstr "运行时 L2 重新配置"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1168
msgid ""
"These endpoints are available when the server has a runtime-"
"reconfigurable L2 adapter. They only change LMCache runtime mappings and "
"metadata; backend resources such as DAX device paths must already exist "
"and be readable and writable by the server. The endpoint routes "
"``backend``, ``operation``, and the JSON request body into the generic L2"
" adapter reconfiguration API, while backend-specific validation and "
"migration semantics stay inside the adapter."
msgstr ""
"这些端点在服务器具有可运行时重新配置的 L2 适配器时可用。它们仅更改 LMCache 的运行时映射和元数据；后端资源如 DAX "
"设备路径必须已经存在，并且服务器必须能够读取和写入。该端点将 ``backend``\\ 、\\ ``operation`` 和 JSON "
"请求体路由到通用 L2 适配器重新配置 API，而后端特定的验证和迁移语义则保留在适配器内部。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1175
msgid ""
"``backend`` and ``operation`` path segments are normalized (stripped and "
"lower-cased). Within a request body, ``adapter_index`` (default ``0``) is"
" **backend-local** — it indexes only the adapters of that backend, not "
"the engine-wide adapter list. If an L2 adapter is wrapped by serde, the "
"backend string is still the configured L2 adapter type, not the serde "
"wrapper type."
msgstr ""
"``backend`` 和 ``operation`` 路径段被规范化（去除空格并转为小写）。在请求体内，``adapter_index``\\ "
"（默认为 ``0``）是 **后端本地** 的——它仅索引该后端的适配器，而不是整个引擎的适配器列表。如果 L2 "
"适配器被序列化/反序列化包装，后端字符串仍然是配置的 L2 适配器类型，而不是序列化/反序列化包装类型。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1183
msgid ""
"The backend strings accepted here are discovered via ``GET "
"/config/adapters``: each adapter whose ``reconfigurable`` flag is "
"``true`` can be addressed by its ``type_name``."
msgstr ""
"这里接受的后端字符串通过 ``GET /config/adapters`` 发现：每个 ``reconfigurable`` 标志为 "
"``true`` 的适配器都可以通过其 ``type_name`` 进行访问。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1188
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``GET /reconfigure/{backend}/status``"
msgstr "``GET /reconfigure/{backend}/status``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1190
msgid ""
"Report the runtime-manageable adapters for one backend type. Each adapter"
" entry's ``adapter_index`` is rewritten to its **backend-local** 0-based "
"index (the value to pass back in operation request bodies)."
msgstr ""
"报告一个后端类型的运行时可管理适配器。每个适配器条目的 ``adapter_index`` 被重写为其 **后端本地** 的 0 "
"基索引（在操作请求体中传回的值）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1194
msgid ""
"**Path parameters:** ``backend`` — adapter ``type_name`` (normalized: "
"stripped and lower-cased; discover valid values via ``GET "
"/config/adapters``)."
msgstr ""
"**路径参数:** ``backend`` — 适配器 ``type_name``（标准化：去除空格并小写；通过 ``GET "
"/config/adapters`` 发现有效值）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1210
msgid ""
"An unknown or empty backend returns ``enabled=false``, "
"``num_adapters=0``, ``adapters=[]`` (it is **not** a ``404``)."
msgstr ""
"一个未知或空的后端返回 ``enabled=false``，``num_adapters=0``，``adapters=[]``\\ （这\\ "
"**不是** ``404``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1215
msgid "``200``: status returned (including the unknown-backend case above)."
msgstr "``200``：返回的状态（包括上述未知后端的情况）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1216
msgid "``400``: ``backend`` is empty."
msgstr "``400``: ``backend`` 为空。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1226
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``POST /reconfigure/{backend}/{operation}``"
msgstr "``POST /reconfigure/{backend}/{operation}``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1228
msgid ""
"Apply one reconfiguration operation to a backend adapter. The request "
"body is a JSON object whose accepted fields depend on the backend and "
"operation. The ``200`` response is whatever the storage manager's "
"``reconfigure_l2_adapter`` returns (a backend-defined dict)."
msgstr ""
"将一个重新配置操作应用于后端适配器。请求体是一个 JSON 对象，其接受的字段取决于后端和操作。``200`` 响应是存储管理器的 "
"``reconfigure_l2_adapter`` 返回的内容（一个后端定义的字典）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1233
msgid ""
"**Path parameters:** ``backend`` (adapter ``type_name``) and "
"``operation`` (e.g. ``add`` / ``remove`` / ``resize`` for ``dax``). Both "
"are normalized (stripped and lower-cased)."
msgstr ""
"**路径参数:** ``backend``（适配器 ``type_name``）和 ``operation``（例如 ``add`` / "
"``remove`` / ``resize`` 用于 ``dax``）。两者都经过标准化（去除空格并转为小写）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1237
msgid ""
"For the **generic** path (any backend other than ``dax``), the body "
"carries ``adapter_index`` plus any backend-specific fields, which are "
"forwarded verbatim to the adapter."
msgstr ""
"对于 **通用** 路径（任何后端除了 ``dax``），请求体包含 ``adapter_index`` "
"以及任何特定于后端的字段，这些字段会逐字转发给适配器。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1241
msgid ""
"For **Device-DAX** (``backend=dax``), JSON request bodies are used "
"because DAX paths contain slashes. The accepted operations and fields "
"are:"
msgstr "对于 **Device-DAX** (``backend=dax``)，使用 JSON 请求体，因为 DAX 路径包含斜杠。接受的操作和字段包括："

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1248
msgid "Operation"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1249
msgid "Body fields"
msgstr "主体字段"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1250
msgid "``add``"
msgstr "``add``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1251
msgid ""
"``device_path`` (str, required), ``size`` (int byte count or string such "
"as ``\"100GiB\"``, required), ``adapter_index`` (default ``0``)."
msgstr ""
"``device_path``\\ （str，必填），``size``\\ （字节数或字符串，例如\\ "
"``\"100GiB\"``，必填），``adapter_index``\\ （默认\\ ``0``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1253
msgid "``remove``"
msgstr "``remove``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1254
msgid ""
"``device_path`` (str, required), ``mode`` (``migrate`` | ``evict`` | "
"``drain``, default ``migrate``), ``force`` (bool, default ``false``), "
"``adapter_index`` (default ``0``)."
msgstr ""
"``device_path`` (str, 必需), ``mode`` (``migrate`` | ``evict`` | ``drain``,"
" 默认 ``migrate``), ``force`` (bool, 默认 ``false``), ``adapter_index`` (默认 "
"``0``)。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1257
msgid "``resize``"
msgstr "``resize``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1258
msgid ""
"``device_path`` (str, required), ``size`` (int or string, required), "
"``mode`` (``migrate`` | ``evict``, default ``migrate``), ``force`` (bool,"
" default ``false``), ``adapter_index`` (default ``0``)."
msgstr ""
"``device_path``\\ （str，必需），``size``\\ （int 或 string，必需），``mode``\\ "
"（``migrate`` | ``evict``，默认 ``migrate``），``force``\\ （bool，默认 "
"``false``），``adapter_index``\\ （默认 ``0``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1262
msgid ""
"``size`` accepts an integer byte count or a string with a base-1024 unit "
"suffix (``b``, ``kib``, ``mib``, ``gib``, ``tib`` and the "
"``k``/``m``/``g``/``t`` aliases), e.g. ``\"100GiB\"``; it must resolve to"
" a positive value."
msgstr ""
"``size`` 接受一个整数字节数或带有基于 1024 "
"的单位后缀的字符串（``b``、``kib``、``mib``、``gib``、``tib`` 及其 "
"``k``/``m``/``g``/``t`` 别名），例如 ``\"100GiB\"``；它必须解析为一个正值。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1268
msgid ""
"The body is the backend's ``reconfigure_l2_adapter`` result (a backend-"
"defined dict). A successful DAX ``add`` looks like:"
msgstr "主体是后端的 ``reconfigure_l2_adapter`` 结果（一个后端定义的字典）。成功的 DAX ``add`` 看起来像这样："

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1282
msgid "``200``: success (body is the storage manager's reconfigure result)."
msgstr "``200``: 成功（主体是存储管理器的重新配置结果）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1283
msgid ""
"``400``: empty ``backend``/``operation``, an unsupported DAX operation, "
"or an invalid ``size``."
msgstr "``400``: 空的 ``backend``/``operation``，不支持的 DAX 操作，或无效的 ``size``。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1285
msgid "``404``: ``adapter_index`` is out of range for the backend."
msgstr "``404``: ``adapter_index`` 超出后端范围。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1286
msgid ""
"``422``: request body fails validation (e.g. a missing required field, or"
" an unknown field in a DAX body — DAX bodies reject extras)."
msgstr "``422``: 请求体验证失败（例如，缺少必填字段或 DAX 请求体中的未知字段——DAX 请求体会拒绝额外字段）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1298
msgid ""
"See :doc:`/kv_cache/storage_backends/dax` for detailed request examples, "
"mode semantics, and validation guidance."
msgstr "有关详细的请求示例、模式语义和验证指导，请参阅 :doc:`/kv_cache/storage_backends/dax`。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1302
msgid "Observability"
msgstr "可观察性"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1305
msgid "``GET /metrics``"
msgstr "``GET /metrics``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1307
msgid ""
"Prometheus exposition format for every metric registered on the default "
"``prometheus_client`` registry (``Content-Type: text/plain``). Scrape "
"this directly from Prometheus. See :doc:`observability/index` for the "
"list of exported metrics."
msgstr ""
"默认 ``prometheus_client`` 注册表中注册的每个指标的 Prometheus 展示格式 (``Content-Type: "
"text/plain``)。直接从 Prometheus 抓取此数据。有关导出指标的列表，请参见 "
":doc:`observability/index`。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1312
msgid ""
"**Response** (``200 OK``, ``text/plain``): the Prometheus exposition-"
"format metrics body."
msgstr "**响应** (``200 OK``, ``text/plain``): Prometheus 展示格式的指标主体。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1317
msgid "``200``: metrics returned."
msgstr "``200``：返回的指标。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1326
msgid "``POST /metrics/reset``"
msgstr "``POST /metrics/reset``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1328
msgid ""
"Resets all LMCache observability metrics to their initial state "
"(``reset_observability_metrics``). Intended for test harnesses and "
"benchmarks — not for production."
msgstr ""
"将所有 LMCache 可观察性指标重置为初始状态（\\ ``reset_observability_metrics``\\ "
"）。面向测试框架和基准测试，不适用于生产环境。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1332 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1598
msgid "**Response** (``200 OK``, ``text/plain``):"
msgstr "**响应**\\ （``200 OK``, ``text/plain``）："

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1340
msgid "``200``: metrics reset."
msgstr "``200``：指标已重置。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1349
msgid "Diagnostics and Debugging"
msgstr "诊断与调试"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1352
msgid "``GET /loglevel``"
msgstr "``GET /loglevel``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1354
msgid ""
"Inspect or mutate Python logger levels at runtime. All responses are "
"``text/plain``. The endpoint has three modes driven by query parameters:"
msgstr "在运行时检查或修改 Python 日志记录器级别。所有响应都是 ``text/plain``\\ 。该端点有三种模式，由查询参数驱动："

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1361 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1408
#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1445
msgid "Query"
msgstr "查询"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1362 ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1409
#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1446
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行为"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1363
msgid "(no params)"
msgstr "(无参数)"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1364
msgid "List every logger registered with :mod:`logging` and its level."
msgstr "列出所有在 :mod:`logging` 中注册的记录器及其级别。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1365
msgid "``?logger_name=<name>``"
msgstr "``?logger_name=<name>``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1366
msgid "Return the effective level of the named logger."
msgstr "返回指定记录器的有效级别。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1367
msgid "``?logger_name=<name>&level=<LEVEL>``"
msgstr "``?logger_name=<name>&level=<LEVEL>``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1368
msgid ""
"Set the named logger (and its handlers) to ``LEVEL`` "
"(``DEBUG``/``INFO``/``WARNING``/``ERROR``/``CRITICAL``; case-"
"insensitive). Returns ``400`` on an unknown level."
msgstr ""
"将命名的日志记录器（及其处理程序）设置为 ``LEVEL``\\ "
"（``DEBUG``/``INFO``/``WARNING``/``ERROR``/``CRITICAL``；不区分大小写）。如果级别未知，则返回"
" ``400``。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1372
msgid ""
"Passing ``level`` without ``logger_name`` matches none of the modes and "
"returns ``200`` with a ``null`` body."
msgstr "传递 ``level`` 而不带 ``logger_name`` 不匹配任何模式，并返回 ``200`` 和一个 ``null`` 响应体。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1375
msgid ""
"**Response** (``200 OK``, ``text/plain``): one ``<logger>: <LEVEL>`` line"
" per registered logger (list mode), a single ``<logger>: <LEVEL>`` (read "
"mode), or a confirmation of the updated level (set mode)."
msgstr ""
"**响应** (``200 OK``, ``text/plain``): 每个注册的日志记录器一行 ``<logger>: "
"<LEVEL>``（列表模式），一个 ``<logger>: <LEVEL>``（读取模式），或更新级别的确认（设置模式）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1381
msgid "``200``: levels listed, read, or set (also the ``null``-body case above)."
msgstr "``200``: 列出、读取或设置的级别（也包括上述的 ``null``-body 情况）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1382
msgid "``400``: ``level`` is not a known logging level."
msgstr "``400``: ``level`` 不是已知的日志级别。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1398
msgid "``GET /threads``"
msgstr "``GET /threads``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1400
msgid ""
"Enumerate active Python threads in the server process along with their "
"stack traces, plus a total-count summary (``Content-Type: text/plain``). "
"Useful for live debugging of hangs or runaway workers."
msgstr ""
"列出服务器进程中活动的 Python 线程及其堆栈跟踪，并提供总计摘要（``Content-Type: "
"text/plain``）。对于实时调试挂起或失控的工作线程非常有用。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1410
msgid "``?name=<substr>``"
msgstr "``?name=<substr>``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1411
msgid "Keep only threads whose name contains ``<substr>`` (case-insensitive)."
msgstr "仅保留名称包含 ``<substr>`` 的线程（不区分大小写）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1413
msgid "``?thread_id=<int>``"
msgstr "``?thread_id=<int>``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1414
msgid "Keep only the thread with the matching ``ident``."
msgstr "仅保留 ``ident`` 匹配的线程。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1418
msgid ""
"The response contains live stack traces and can disclose internal code "
"paths and state. Restrict network access to this endpoint in production."
msgstr "响应包含实时堆栈跟踪，并可能泄露内部代码路径和状态。在生产环境中限制对该端点的网络访问。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1421
msgid ""
"**Response** (``200 OK``, ``text/plain``): a total-thread-count summary "
"followed by each thread's name, ``ident``, and current stack trace."
msgstr "**响应** (``200 OK``, ``text/plain``)：总线程数摘要，后面跟着每个线程的名称、``ident`` 和当前堆栈跟踪。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1426
msgid "``200``: thread listing returned."
msgstr "``200``: 返回线程列表。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1435
msgid "``GET /periodic-threads``"
msgstr "``GET /periodic-threads``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1437
msgid ""
"Returns a JSON snapshot of the "
":class:`~lmcache.v1.periodic_thread.PeriodicThreadRegistry`: counts by "
"level plus per-thread status (last run timestamp, latest summary, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"返回 :class:`~lmcache.v1.periodic_thread.PeriodicThreadRegistry` 的 JSON "
"快照：按级别统计以及每个线程的状态（上次运行时间戳、最新摘要等）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1447
msgid "``?level=critical|high|medium|low``"
msgstr "``?level=critical|high|medium|low``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1448
msgid "Only include threads at the given level. ``400`` on unknown."
msgstr "仅包含给定级别的线程。对未知情况返回 ``400``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1449
msgid "``?running_only=true``"
msgstr "``?running_only=true``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1450
msgid "Only include threads currently running."
msgstr "仅包含当前正在运行的线程。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1451
msgid "``?active_only=true``"
msgstr "``?active_only=true``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1452
msgid "Only include threads considered active (recent tick)."
msgstr "仅包括被视为活动的线程（最近的滴答）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1488
msgid "``200``: snapshot returned."
msgstr "``200``: 返回快照。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1489
msgid "``400``: unknown ``level`` filter."
msgstr "``400``: 未知 ``level`` 过滤器。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1498
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``GET /periodic-threads/{thread_name}``"
msgstr "``GET /periodic-threads/{thread_name}``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1500
msgid ""
"Detailed status for a single periodic thread (the same per-thread object "
"shown in the ``threads`` list above)."
msgstr "单个周期性线程的详细状态（与上面 ``threads`` 列表中显示的每个线程对象相同）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1503
msgid ""
"**Path parameters:** ``thread_name`` — the registered periodic thread "
"name."
msgstr "**路径参数:** ``thread_name`` — 注册的周期线程名称。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1522
msgid "**Response** (``404 Not Found``) when the name is unknown:"
msgstr "**响应** (``404 Not Found``) 当名称未知时："

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1530
msgid "``200``: thread status returned."
msgstr "``200``: 返回的线程状态。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1531
msgid "``404``: no periodic thread with that name."
msgstr "``404``: 没有名为该名称的周期性线程。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1540
msgid "``GET /periodic-threads-health``"
msgstr "``GET /periodic-threads-health``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1542
msgid ""
"Fast health check covering only ``critical`` and ``high`` level periodic "
"threads. A thread is flagged unhealthy when it is marked running but has "
"not ticked within its expected interval. Always returns ``200`` — health "
"is conveyed by the ``healthy`` boolean, not the HTTP status."
msgstr ""
"快速健康检查，仅涵盖 ``critical`` 和 ``high`` "
"级别的周期性线程。当线程被标记为运行但在预期间隔内未进行计时时，它会被标记为不健康。始终返回 ``200`` — 健康状态通过 "
"``healthy`` 布尔值传达，而不是通过 HTTP 状态。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1557
msgid "When something is lagging:"
msgstr "当出现滞后时："

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1576
msgid ""
"``200``: health reported — always ``200``, even when unhealthy (the "
"``healthy`` boolean is ``false``)."
msgstr "``200``：健康报告 — 始终为 ``200``，即使在不健康时（``healthy`` 布尔值为 ``false``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1586
msgid "``GET /env``"
msgstr "``GET /env``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1588
msgid ""
"Dumps the process environment variables as a sorted, pretty-printed JSON "
"document. The response ``Content-Type`` is ``text/plain`` so it can be "
"piped directly to a terminal."
msgstr ""
"将进程环境变量转储为排序后的美观打印 JSON 文档。响应的 ``Content-Type`` 为 "
"``text/plain``，因此可以直接通过管道传输到终端。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1594
msgid ""
"The payload contains **every** environment variable, including any "
"secrets injected via the environment. There is no redaction or auth — "
"restrict network access to this endpoint in production."
msgstr "有效负载包含 **每个** 环境变量，包括通过环境注入的任何秘密。没有任何编辑或身份验证 — 在生产环境中限制对该端点的网络访问。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1610
msgid "``200``: environment dump returned."
msgstr "``200``: 环境转储已返回。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1619
msgid "``POST /run_script``"
msgstr "``POST /run_script``"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1621
msgid ""
"Execute an uploaded Python script inside the server process. The script "
"is uploaded as multipart form data under the field name ``script`` and is"
" ``exec``'d with a restricted ``__builtins__`` (only ``print``, ``str``, "
"``int``, ``float``, ``list``, ``dict``, ``tuple``, ``set``, and a guarded"
" ``__import__``). Only modules listed in ``--script-allowed-imports`` can"
" be imported; the running FastAPI ``app`` is injected into the script "
"globals. If the script assigns a variable named ``result``, its "
"stringified value is returned; otherwise the body is ``\"Script executed "
"successfully\"`` (``Content-Type: text/plain``)."
msgstr ""
"在服务器进程中执行上传的 Python 脚本。脚本作为多部分表单数据上传，字段名称为 ``script``，并在受限的 "
"``__builtins__`` 下被 ``exec`` 执行（仅允许 "
"``print``、``str``、``int``、``float``、``list``、``dict``、``tuple``、``set`` "
"和受保护的 ``__import__``）。仅允许导入在 ``--script-allowed-imports`` 中列出的模块；运行的 "
"FastAPI ``app`` 会注入到脚本的全局变量中。如果脚本赋值给名为 ``result`` 的变量，则返回其字符串化值；否则返回正文为 "
"``\"脚本成功执行\"``\\ （``Content-Type: text/plain``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1631
msgid ""
"**Request body:** multipart form data with a single ``script`` file field"
" (the Python source to execute). Not a JSON body."
msgstr "**请求体：** 多部分表单数据，包含一个 ``script`` 文件字段（要执行的 Python 源代码）。不是 JSON 格式的请求体。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1636
msgid ""
"This endpoint runs caller-supplied code in-process. The restricted "
"builtins are **not** a security sandbox — combined with the injected "
"``app`` object and any allowed imports, treat it as full remote code "
"execution. Never expose it on an untrusted network."
msgstr ""
"此端点在进程中运行调用者提供的代码。受限的内置函数\\ **不是**\\ 安全沙箱——结合注入的\\ ``app``\\ "
"对象和任何允许的导入，将其视为完全的远程代码执行。切勿在不受信任的网络上公开它。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1641
msgid ""
"**Response** (``200 OK``, ``text/plain``): the stringified ``result`` "
"variable if the script assigns one, otherwise ``Script executed "
"successfully``."
msgstr ""
"**响应** (``200 OK``, ``text/plain``): 如果脚本分配了字符串化的 ``result`` "
"变量，则返回该变量，否则返回 ``脚本成功执行``。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1646
msgid "``200``: script executed."
msgstr "``200``: 脚本已执行。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1647
msgid "``400``: no ``script`` file provided."
msgstr "``400``: 未提供 ``script`` 文件。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1648
msgid ""
"``500``: an exception was raised during import setup or execution (body: "
"``\"Error executing script: <reason>\"``)."
msgstr "``500``: 在导入设置或执行期间引发了异常（主体：``\"执行脚本时出错：<reason>\"``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1659
msgid "Adding New Endpoints"
msgstr "添加新端点"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1661
msgid ""
"Endpoints are auto-discovered from "
"``lmcache/v1/multiprocess/http_apis/``. To add a new MP-only endpoint:"
msgstr "端点会从 ``lmcache/v1/multiprocess/http_apis/`` 自动发现。要添加一个新的仅限 MP 的端点："

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1664
msgid "Create a new module in that directory named ``<name>_api.py``."
msgstr "在该目录中创建一个名为 ``<name>_api.py`` 的新模块。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1665
msgid "Define a module-level ``router = APIRouter()``."
msgstr "定义一个模块级的 ``router = APIRouter()``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1666
msgid "Register handlers on ``router`` using FastAPI decorators."
msgstr "使用 FastAPI 装饰器在 ``router`` 上注册处理程序。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1667
msgid ""
"Access the engine via ``request.app.state.engine`` and guard for the "
"``None`` case (engine not yet initialized)."
msgstr "通过 ``request.app.state.engine`` 访问引擎，并检查 ``None`` 情况（引擎尚未初始化）。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1670
msgid ""
"The :class:`~lmcache.v1.multiprocess.http_api_registry.HTTPAPIRegistry` "
"will pick the module up automatically at startup — no central "
"registration list to edit."
msgstr ""
":class:`~lmcache.v1.multiprocess.http_api_registry.HTTPAPIRegistry` "
"将在启动时自动加载模块 — 无需编辑中央注册列表。"

#: ../../source/mp/http_api.rst:1674
msgid ""
"If the route is generic enough to be shared with the vLLM-embedded API "
"server, add it under ``lmcache/v1/internal_api_server/common/`` instead. "
"It will be picked up on the MP side via ``common_api.py`` unless its "
"module name is listed in ``_MP_INCOMPATIBLE_MODULES`` there (reserved for"
" modules that require vLLM-specific ``app.state`` attributes; the list is"
" currently empty). A handler that lives under "
"``internal_api_server/vllm/`` can still be surfaced on the MP server by "
"including its router from a group module under ``http_apis/`` (as "
"``info_api.py`` does for the version endpoints)."
msgstr ""
"如果路由足够通用，可以与嵌入 vLLM 的 API 服务器共享，请将其添加到 "
"``lmcache/v1/internal_api_server/common/`` 下。它将在 MP 端通过 ``common_api.py``"
" 被加载，除非其模块名称在 ``_MP_INCOMPATIBLE_MODULES`` 中列出（该列表保留给需要 vLLM 特定 "
"``app.state`` 属性的模块；当前列表为空）。位于 ``internal_api_server/vllm/`` "
"下的处理程序仍然可以通过从 ``http_apis/`` 下的组模块中包含其路由器在 MP 服务器上显示（如 ``info_api.py`` "
"对版本端点所做的那样）。"

